  <Intro>k__BackingField: The new king sits in the capital under a crown glued back together, and the land is afraid of the dark again. Let it be. Ysolde marches on the capital, and nothing that falls on the way stays down.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: The bells of the capital ring once, and then never again. Ysolde does not wear the crown. She has no need of it.
  <Goal>k__BackingField: Defeat every realm that stands against the coven.
  <Loss>k__BackingField: Ysolde must not fall.
